  "notes": "Built-in Agent + Skill Bundle Pipeline implemented. Key changes:\n\n1. **src/core/builtins/** — 15 agents (agent.json + PROMPT.md each) + 21 skills (manifest.json + SKILL.md each) seeded from .deckent/ dev workspace. Dev stats zeroed for clean distribution.\n\n2. **scripts/bundle-builtins.mjs** — Dev→src/core/builtins sync script with --dry-run, --clean-stats flags. Skips temp-* and archive dirs.\n\n3. **src/cli/commands/init-steps.ts** — Added seedBuiltins() function called during writeBrainFiles() init flow. Uses writeIfNotExists pattern (idempotent — preserves user overrides). Resolves builtins path via import.meta.url (ESM compatible).\n\n4. **copy-assets.mjs** — Already handles .json + .md in src/ → dist/ copy. No changes needed — builtins auto-included.\n\n5. **package.json** — files[] already includes 'dist', no changes needed.\n\n6. **Tests** — 14 tests in tests/e2e/init-builtin-seed.test.ts: seed pipeline, directory count, file integrity, JSON schema validation, idempotent override preservation, no temp agents, content size checks, bundled stats verification.\n\nVerification:\n- tsc --noEmit: PASS (0 errors)\n- vitest run tests/e2e/init-builtin-seed.test.ts: 14/14 PASS\n- npm pack --dry-run: 30 agent files (15×2) + 42 skill files (21×2) in tarball\n- dist/core/builtins/: 15 agents + 21 skills confirmed",
